-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",73,{
[2305]="70072EA6\n1\tFree prisoners (total: 6)\030Defeat Ordâkhai (total: 12)\tPrisoners are held in cages throughout Kôth Rau. You should free them and defeat the Ordâkhai soldiers you encounter.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of Damudûr at the mountain's base\tYou have freed the prisoners and defeated many soldiers of Ordâkh. You should return to Damudûr, the dark cleft at the base of the mountain.\n3\tDefeat Kulgath the Ruiner\tYou have freed the prisoners and defeated many soldiers of Ordâkh, earning the attention of an Utûgi champion, Kulgath the Ruiner.\n",
[2306]="7002B0F9\n1\tAccuse drunkards of disorderly conduct (total: 7)\tParty-goers can be found all over the Farmers Faire market area in Bywater during the festival. You should accuse drunkards of drunken and disorderly behaviour to keep the party in line. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tSpeak with Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is in Bywater in the Shire. You should speak with Bounder Boffin, and let him know that the party is under control.\n",
[2307]="700395DE\n1\tThe Bounders of the Shire need your help. Return the tokens that you have found to the Bounders in Michel Delving and help Middle-earth protect the bounds of the Shire.\t\n2\tSpeak to Meg Proudfoot in Michel Delving\tThe Bounders of the Shire need your help. Return the token that you have found to the Bounders in Michel Delving and help Middle-earth protect the bounds of the Shire.\n",
[2308]="70071630\n1\tCollect packaged meals\tBatâla has asked you to deliver meals to the residents of Ahâba. You should collect the packaged meals. They are in a bag near Batâla's hut.\n2\tYou have collected the package of meals to deliver to the residents of Ahâba. You should deliver the meals to Beltáni shepherds and hunters around the village.\t\n3\tTalk to Batâla\tYou have delivered meals to the Beltáni. You should return to Batâla.\n",
[2309]="7000EF77\n1\tCollect Ice Bay Salmon (total: 12)\tTapio told you to fish where the sea bubbles and boils.\n2\tBring the icebay salmon to Tapio\tBring the icebay salmon back to Tapio.\n",
[2310]="70053DC2\n1\tDefeat Mordorrim cultists in Parth Daenath (total: 10)\030Defeat Agan-khô in Parth Daenath\tMordorrim can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Mordorrim cultists and their leader, Agan-khô.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Mordorrim cultists.\n",
[2311]="70067CAE\n1\tSpeak with Yitro at his home in lower Halrax\tSeek Yitro at his home in lower Halrax and let him know that you are interested in assisting in bringing the Uruk Akrax the Vile to justice.\n2\tFind a secluded location east outside of Halrax\030Find and eliminate Akraz the Vile\tYitro directed you to find a secluded spot east and north out of Halrax in which to feign weakness to draw out Akraz the Vile.\n3\tTalk to Yitro\tYitro awaits word of your battle against Akraz the Vile at his home in lower Halrax. Return to him.\n",
[2312]="70059767\n1\tSummon and confront Akvosh\tAkvosh can be found at the West-delf in the Wildwood. You should summon and confront Akvosh.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Akvosh.\n",
[2313]="70071627\n1\tDefeat Akílu the Feaster\030Burn animal carcasses (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a bounty to defeat Akílu the Feaster and clean up the Fane of Shahûru. You should travel to the Fane of Shahûru, north of Ahâba and complete the bounty.\n2\tTalk to Shâpar\tYou have defeated Akílu the Feaster and cleaned up the Fane of Shahûru. You should return to Shâpar in Ahâba for your reward.\n",
[2314]="70009A0E\n1\tTalk to Poppy Seaton\tPoppy Seaton is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. A poster advertising a bounty for the capture or defeat of a tomb-robber named Andy Idden caught your eye. If you would like to apply for this bounty, you should speak with Poppy Seaton.\n2\tDefeat Andy Idden\tAndy Idden and his wolf-hound are meeting with the goblins of Tham Andalath, hill-top ruins east of Canadiach in Parth Aduial, south of Ost Forod and north of the road. You have accepted the commission of claiming the bounty on Andy Idden.\n3\tTalk to Poppy Seaton\tPoppy Seaton is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. You have defeated Andy Idden and should now report back to Poppy Seaton.\n4\tTalk to Basil Gummidge\tBasil Gummidge is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. You have defeated Andy Idden and should now report to Basil Gummidge to collect your reward.\n",
[2315]="7001AF97\n1\tDeliver the barghest-eyes to Edith Sweetrose\030Collect barghest-eyes (total: 10)\tBarghests can be found within the southern Barrow-downs, Some barghests can chill a being with but a gaze. Edith Sweetrose, at Dead Man's Perch, has offered to provide you a reward for collecting barghest-eyes taken from the southern-dwelling barghests. NOTE: Bounty quests are repeatable quests, but have a finite number of completions. This quest can be completed three times.\n",
[2316]="7005A94F\n1\tDefeat Barzglúk\030Defeat bats in Máttugard (total: 12)\tBarzglúk and bats can be found in Máttugard. You should defeat bats.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Barzglúk.\n",
[2317]="7001B250\n1\tBring the bear-hides to Sage Hayseed\030Collect unmarred bear-hides (total: 10)\tBears can be found throughout the northern Bree-fields. Sage Hayseed has asked you to collect bear-hides from the bears in the northern Bree-fields and surrounding areas and return them to her. She has offered to pay you a fair price for this effort. NOTE: Bounty quests are repeatable quests, but have a finite number of completions. This quest can be completed three times.\n",
[2318]="70009A0B\n1\tTalk to Clark Standish\tClark Standish is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. A poster advertising a bounty for the capture or defeat of a tomb-robber named Bill Tripper caught your eye. If you would like to apply for this bounty, you should speak with Clark Standish.\n2\tDefeat Bill Tripper\tBill Tripper is in the ruins of Tham Varan in Parth Aduial, south of the cross-roads of Canadiach. You have accepted the commission of the bounty on Bill Tripper.\n3\tTalk to Clark Standish\tClark Standish is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. You have defeated Bill Tripper and should now report back to Clark Standish.\n4\tTalk to Basil Gummidge\tBasil Gummidge is in Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech. You have defeated Bill Tripper and should now report to Basil Gummidge to collect your reward.\n",
[2319]="70071AD2\n1\tCollect the hide of Biret-kôda\tBiret-kôda is said to often be found in Uhumêlu, south-east of the Beast-fields. You should defeat Biret-kôda and collect his hide.\n2\tBring the hide to Mísikir in Jiret-menêsh\tYou have defeated Biret-kôda and collected his hide. You should take it to Jiret-menêsh to get your reward.\n",
[2320]="70053DBD\n1\tDefeat Black Númenórean soldiers in Parth Daenath (total: 8)\030Defeat Black Númenórean captains in Parth Daenath (total: 3)\tBlack Númenóreans can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat Black Númenórean soldiers and their captains.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Black Númenórean soldiers.\n",
[2321]="7004E910\n1\tDefeat Blackhorn\030Defeat mountain rams (total: 10)\tBlackhorn and other mountain rams can be found in Ered Mithrin. You should defeat rams.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Blackhorn.\n",
[2322]="70045220\n1\tDefeat the Black Serpent\tThe Black Serpent rallies the Men of Harad to greater viciousness as the many forces of Sauron move against Minas Tirith. In addition to his sons, the strongest of the Enemy's forces creep onto the field in search of you and your fellows.\n",
[2323]="7005467C\n1\tDefeat Blood-singer Maurgol\tBlood-singer Maurgol can be found somewhere in the Circle of Madness. Defeat Blood-singer Maurgol.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[2324]="7005FFA2\n1\tCollect bone amulets from the Dead in Câr Bronach (total: 12)\tThe Dead can be found in Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Lísek promises a bounty for the collection of bone amulets from the Dead in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver the bone amulets to Lísek at Grúmachath\tLísek can be found at Grúmachath. You have collected a sufficient number of bone amulets and should now deliver them to Lísek for a bounty.\n",
[2325]="7003FC4E\n1\tSearch the dungeon for hints of Candúr's intentions\tThe dungeon where Candúr was kept can be found in the north-west corner of Calembel. You should see if there is any evidence in the dungeon as to where Candúr might have gone when he escaped.\n2\tTownsfolk who may have seen or heard something of Candúr can be found throughought Calembel. You should speak with townsfolk to see if you can glean any clues to Candúr's whereabouts.\t\n3\tFind a witness in Calembel\tTownsfolk who may have seen or heard something of Candúr can be found throughought Calembel. You should speak with townsfolk to see if you can glean any clues to Candúr's whereabouts.\n4\tSee if anyone saw Candúr just west of Calembel\tCandúr crawled over the wall just west of the woman who witnessed his escape. You should search directly west to see if Candúr left any traces to allow him to be followed.\n5\tSearch north upstream for Candúr\tCandúr, now armed, likely fled north upstream. You should search along the river for signs of Candúr. His trail is not yet cold!\n6\tFind and capture Candúr\tAccording to townsfolk of Calembel, Candúr escaped to the west of town. You should seek and recapture Candúr, the man who murdered his own brother.\n7\tCollect your reward from Laindir\tLaindir can be found in Calembel. You should return to Laindir and collect your reward for defeating the deadly and murderous Candúr.\n",
[2326]="7005467A\n1\tDefeat Captain Hethulos\tCaptain Hethulos can be found somewhere in the Circle of Madness. You should defeat Captain Hethulos.\n2\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol is stationed inside Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n",
[2327]="7001AF98\n1\tBring the relics to Edith Sweetrose\030Collect relics of Cardolan (total: 10)\tAny of the creatures in the southern Barrow-downs may carry trinkets and relics from the kingdom of Cardolan. Edith Sweetrose will trade crafting materials for any relics of Cardolan you may find. NOTE: Bounty quests are repeatable quests, but have a finite number of completions. This quest can be completed three times.\n",
[2328]="7003FCBD\n1\tQuestion witnesses at Bar Elir\tBar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel. You should speak with the farmers at Bar Elir to hear their report of the chicken-thief directly.\n2\tFind the chicken-thief's hideout\tThe chicken-thief is reported to have likely gone west of Bar Elir in southern Lamedon, likely taking cover in the shelter of trees and rocks in the hills. You should search for the chicken-thief.\n3\tCollect stolen chickens (total: 6)\tThe chicken-thief has gathered chickens west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon. The thief is nowhere to be found, but the chickens should be returned to their coop.\n4\tCatch the chicken-thief\tThe chicken-thief's hideout is west of Bar Elir, in southern Lamedon. See what the chicken-thief was cooking while you wait for him to return.\n5\tReturn the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir\tBar Elir, a farmstead, is south-west of Calembel. You should return the chickens to the farmers at Bar Elir.\n6\tCollect your reward from Laindir\tLaindir can be found in Calembel in Lamedon. You should return to Laindir in Calembel and tell him that you found the hideout, and defeated the thief.\n",
[2329]="7006AA3A\n1\tReach the Hakâri camp to the north of Jadambor\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of Hakâri in Ghâs Hejai. It can be found to the north of Jadambor.\n2\tDefeat Hakâri within Ghâs Hejai (total: 12)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of Hakâri in Ghâs Hejai. It can be found to the north of Jadambor.\n3\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of cultists.\n",
[2330]="7006AA3B\n1\tReach Jalkhûl to the south-east of Jadambor\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of spiders in Jalkhûl. It can be found to the south-east of Jadambor.\n2\tDefeat spiders within Jalkhûl (total: 12)\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to reduce the number of spiders in Jalkhûl. It can be found to the south-east of Jadambor.\n3\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that you have culled the number of spiders\t\n",
[2331]="7006AA3E\n1\tDestroy the northern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\030Destroy the eastern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\030Destroy the southern rat nest in western Dil-irmíz\tYou accepted a bounty notice asking you to clear out rat nests in the area. There is one to the north, one to the east, and one to the south of Jadambor.\n2\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed\tInform Zûfan in Jadambor that the nests have been destroyed.\n",
[2332]="700453E5\n1\tDefeat Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men Statues (total: 10)\tGhûrdhos can be found near Púkel-men statues in Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men statues.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated Ghûrdhos near Púkel-men statues.\n",
[2333]="700413B6\n1\tRoughed up corsairs at the Fallen Beacon (total: 8)\tThe Fallen Beacon can be found on the border of Lamedon and Ringló Vale. You should defeat corsairs at the Fallen Beacon.\n2\tSpeak with Jajax\tJajax is located inside the Ethring tavern. You should speak with Jajax.\n",
[2334]="7001C071\n1\tBring the meat to Glaednoth\030Collect crunchy crawler-meat (total: 10)\tCrawlers can be found throughout the swamp of Harloeg. Glaednoth is located at Ost Haer in the southern most reaches of Harloeg. Glaednoth has asked you to collect meat from the crawlers of Harloeg. NOTE: Bounty quests are repeatable quests, but have a finite number of completions. This quest can be completed three times.\n",
[2335]="7005FFA5\n1\tDefeat Crótharc and collect his horns\tCrótharc can be found somewhere in the eastern reaches of Câr Bronach. A bounty posted by Rádek promises a bounty for the horns of the mighty hill-ram, Crótharc, in Câr Bronach.\n2\tDeliver Crótharc's horns to Rádek at Grúmachath\tRádek can be found at Grúmachath. You have claimed Crótharc's horns as a trophy and should now deliver them to Rádek for a bounty.\n",
[2336]="70053DB9\n1\tDefeat darkwaters in Rath Dúath (total: 12)\tDarkwaters can be found in Rath Dúath. You should defeat darkwaters.\n2\tCompleted\tDefeated darkwaters.\n",
})
